{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25199","headline":"所居寺院凉夜书情呈上吕和叔温郎中 · 何元上","name":"所居寺院凉夜书情呈上吕和叔温郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庾公念病宜清暑，遣向僧家占上方。\n月光似水衣裳湿，松气如秋枕簟凉。\n幸以薄才当客次，无因弱羽逐鸾翔。\n何由一示云霄路，肠断星星两鬓霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何元上","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}